    <title>Tâche principale FreeRTOS</title>
    <sectiondef kind="func">
      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__grp__tache_1gae9bf934dd2f4a12a5c5975d81afa3063" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void StartLwipTask</definition>
        <argsstring>(void const *argument)</argsstring>
        <name>StartLwipTask</name>
        <param>
          <type>void const *</type>
          <declname>argument</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Tache FreeRTOS principale (lwipTask). Initialise LwIP, les verrous (I2C, UART, commandes), la reception UART, les tables issues du CSV (LDO_InitialiserTables()), les seuils OC, les DAC (configuration, restauration EEPROM), les commandes ON/OFF (flash), l&apos;EXTI des OC et le serveur UDP, puis boucle sans fin : etat des LDO, surveillance OC, sauvegardes EEPROM/flash differees, commande UART en attente, boutons (capture complete, reset des multiplexeurs). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>argument</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Non utilise (signature imposee par osThreadDef). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<parameterlist kind="retval"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Aucun</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>(void). Ne retourne jamais. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Exemple d&apos;utilisation</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>Cree<sp/>par<sp/>main()<sp/>(code<sp/>CubeMX)<sp/>:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">osThreadDef(lwipTask,<sp/>StartLwipTask,<sp/>osPriorityNormal,<sp/>0,<sp/>256);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">lwipTaskHandle<sp/>=<sp/>osThreadCreate(osThread(lwipTask),<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
